# Overtime Claim Sheet — read AGENTS.md

This repo is a **mobile PWA** for logging phlebotomy overtime and downloading the **official Synnovis Excel template** (`public/template.xlsx`). **Never recreate the spreadsheet layout.**

**Live:** https://tawfiqahmedabir.github.io/overtime-claim-sheet/

**Repo:** https://github.com/TawfiqAhmedAbir/overtime-claim-sheet (`main` → auto-deploy to Pages)

**Full context:** [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md) — status, cell map, architecture, V4 backlog, next steps. **V3 shipped** (Aug 2026).

## Quick rules for agents

1. Excel output must load `public/template.xlsx`, fill mapped cells only, then download/share.
2. After any `src/lib/excel.ts` change: run `npm run test:excel`.
3. After any `src/lib/hours.ts` change: run `npm run test:overtime`.
4. Keep `stripFormulaResults()` before save — prevents ExcelJS writing invalid `NaN` cached values.
5. Column D = auto-calculated overtime text; override via scroll only. Formula: weekday `(finish − start − break) − normalShift`; weekend/BH = full on-site time.
6. Row for day N: `N + 14`. Month anchor: cell **H7** (UTC noon, 1st of month).
7. Use `ConfirmSheet` for confirms — no `window.confirm` / `window.alert`.
8. User prefers **plan first, wait for "Go"** before implementing non-trivial changes.
9. **Do not git commit** unless the user explicitly asks.
